# Plan authoring (repo)

When creating or materially updating an implementation plan:

1. Write **`docs/Plans/<main>_<sub>_<kind>.md`** (canonical).
2. Optionally add **`docs/Plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`** as a dated snapshot.

**Do not** create, update, or cite **`docs/Plans/latest.md`**.

**Do not** use Architect webhook env vars or curl POST flows for plan review.

Before firmware from an approved plan, follow [Plan-Pre-Implementation-Review.mdc](Plan-Pre-Implementation-Review.mdc).
